  "instructions": [
    "In a donabe vessel, heat ghee over low heat.",
    "Add satvik-friendly fermented rice bran paste and mix well.",
    "Add chestnut mushrooms, dried parsley, kalonji, salt, and black pepper. Mix well.",
    "Add coconut oil, turmeric, and ginger powder. Mix well.",
    "Steam the mixture using 4 leaf wraps for 10 minutes.",
    "Remove the donabe from heat and let it rest for 2 minutes.",
    "Open the donabe and check if the mushrooms are cooked through and the liquid has been absorbed.",
    "Serve immediately, garnished with fresh coriander leaves.",
    "Enjoy your Zesty Leaf-Wrap-Steamed Satvik Chestnut Mushroom Wrap!"
